ZoiteChat is a GTK3 IRC client based on HexChat. It allows you to join
multiple IRC channels at the same time, talk publicly or in private
one-on-one conversations, and transfer files over DCC.

Features include SASL and other authentication methods, proxy support,
spell checking, alerts and notifications, logging, custom themes, and
HexChat-compatible Python, Perl and Lua scripting through a plugin API.
